* SKY130 nfet_01v8 terminal currents under gate and drain ramps (charges, body network)
* Requires the open_pdks/volare SKY130 build under va-models/volare-sky130 (sky130A).
* Provenance: original SKY130 test circuit.
.lib "../../va-models/volare-sky130/sky130A/libs.tech/ngspice/sky130.lib.spice" tt
vg g 0 pwl(0 0 0.5n 1.8 1n 0)
vd d 0 pwl(0 1.8 0.25n 0 0.75n 1.8 1n 0.9)
vs s 0 0
vb b 0 0
xm1 d g s b sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.15 nf=2 ad=0.29 as=0.29 pd=2.58 ps=2.58
.tran 1p 1n 0 1p
.end
